url: "https://github.com/olaflaitinen/llm-proteomics-hallucination"
abstract: "A prospective evaluation study assessing hallucination rates in large language model (LLM) responses to proteomics-related queries. This repository contains all code, data, and analysis for the manuscript submitted to The Lancet Digital Health. We evaluated three frontier LLMs (GPT-4 Turbo, Claude 3 Sonnet, Gemini Pro 1.5) on 500 proteomics queries and found an overall hallucination rate of 31.2% (95% CI: 28.7-33.8%)."
